OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry call over decision to     
OL,4,Adeclare city 'bankrupt'                
OL,6,FA call has been made for a public      
OL,7,Finquiry into the decision to declare   
OL,8,FNottingham City Council effectively    
OL,9,Fbankrupt.                              
OL,11,FIn November 2023, the Labour-led       
OL,12,Fcouncil's then chief finance officer,  
OL,13,FRoss Brown, issued a Section 114 notice
OL,14,Fover a reported #23m overspend, saying 
OL,15,Fit could not set a balanced budget,    
OL,16,Fwhich it is legally required to.       
OL,18,FCuts, job losses, and the appointment  
OL,19,Fof government commissioners in February
OL,20,F2024 followed the decision.            
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
