OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry call over decision to     
OL,4,Adeclare city 'bankrupt'                
OL,6,FBut city councillor Graham Chapman     
OL,7,F(Lab), who served as deputy leader for 
OL,8,F15 years, told the Local Democracy     
OL,9,FReporting Service that Nottingham was  
OL,10,F"never bankrupt" and wants a public    
OL,11,Finquiry into the declaration.          
